+
+### HYPOT
+Returns the hypotenuse of two numbers. The input can be any numeric values, the return value is always a double.
+Hypotenuses of infinities are null.
+
+```
+ROW a = 3.0, b = 4.0
+| EVAL c = HYPOT(a, b)
+```
